              {nmtc_projects.toLocaleString()}
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-oz-neutral-500 mb-2">Prior NMTC investments in eligible OZ tracts</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-oz-neutral-400">
              CDFI Fund <a href="https://www.cdfifund.gov/programs-training/tax-credits/nmtc" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-oz-neutral-600">NMTC Public Data Release</a> (2024).
              Indicates prior CDFI capital deployment track record in these tracts.
              See <a href="/capital-stack#nmtc" class="underline hover:text-oz-neutral-600">how NMTC and OZ stack →</a>
            </p>
