                target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-oz-neutral-600">Urban Institute investability model</a> scores
              OZ-eligible tracts by predicted likelihood of attracting private capital, based on OZ 1.0
              investment patterns. Quintile 1 = highest predicted investability among scored tracts.
