          with Treasury, which has 30 days from receipt to certify, extendable by another 30. Until
          that certification lands, no list circulating publicly is final — states could revise a
          filing right up to the moment their window shut, and Treasury does not act on early filings
          early.
        </p>

        {nomination.status === 'filed_confirmed' ? (
          <div class="mb-4 border-l-4 border-oz-blue bg-oz-neutral-50 pl-4 py-3 pr-4">
