        strategies available when a state hasn't opened a formal process.
        While waiting, the <a href="https://www.acceleratorforamerica.org/oztoolkit/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-oz-neutral-700">Accelerator for America OZ Designation Toolkit</a> provides
        frameworks you can prepare in advance.
      </p>
    )}
  </section>
  )}

